			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "This function maps any large integer into a value between 0 and 9, making it directly usable\nas an index in a hash table array. Hashing eliminates the need to perform an iterative linear\nsearch across an entire dataset by establishing a direct mathematical link between a key and\nits storage location.",
			"rawText": "This function maps any large integer into a value between 0 and 9, making it directly usable as an index in a hash table array. Hashing eliminates the need to perform an iterative linear search across an entire dataset by establishing a direct mathematical link between a key and its storage location.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "This function maps any large integer into a value between 0 and 9, making it directly usable as an index in a hash table array. Hashing eliminates the need to perform an iterative linear search across an entire dataset by establishing a direct mathematical link between a key and its storage location.",
