			"updated": 1783798733036,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- Table Size: 100 slots (valid indices range from 0 to 99).\n- Design Note: Utilizing the last two digits ensures a more random distribution. \n  Using the first two digits (such as area codes or carrier prefixes) causes clustering\n  and severe collisions because many phone numbers share identical starting segments.",
			"rawText": "- Table Size: 100 slots (valid indices range from 0 to 99).\n- Design Note: Utilizing the last two digits ensures a more random distribution. \n  Using the first two digits (such as area codes or carrier prefixes) causes clustering \n  and severe collisions because many phone numbers share identical starting segments.",
